{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "KJV1769",
  "book_code": "ROM",
  "chapter": 11,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I say then, Hath God cast away his people? God forbid. For I also am an Israelite, of the seed of Abraham, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the tribe of Benjamin.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "God hath not cast away his people which he foreknew. Wot ye not what the scripture saith of Elias? how he maketh intercession to God against Israel, saying,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Lord, they have killed thy prophets, and digged down thine altars; and I am left alone, and they seek my life.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But what saith the answer of God unto him? I have reserved to myself seven thousand men, who have not bowed the knee to ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "the image of",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Baal.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Even so then at this present time also there is a remnant according to the election of grace.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And if by grace, then ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " no more of works: otherwise grace is no more grace. But if ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of works, then is it no more grace: otherwise work is no more work.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "What then? Israel hath not obtained that which he seeketh for; but the election hath obtained it, and the rest were blinded",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "(According as it is written, God hath given them the spirit of slumber, eyes that they should not see, and ears that they should not hear;) unto this day.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And David saith, Let their table be made a snare, and a trap, and a stumblingblock, and a recompence unto them:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let their eyes be darkened, that they may not see, and bow down their back alway.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I say then, Have they stumbled that they should fall? God forbid: but ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "rather",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " through their fall salvation ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is come",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " unto the Gentiles, for to provoke them to jealousy.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now if the fall of them ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the riches of the world, and the diminishing of them the riches of the Gentiles; how much more their fulness?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I speak to you Gentiles, inasmuch as I am the apostle of the Gentiles, I magnify mine office:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If by any means I may provoke to emulation ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them which are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my flesh, and might save some of them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For if the casting away of them ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the reconciling of the world, what ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the receiving ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of them be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", but life from the dead?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For if the firstfruit ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " holy, the lump ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " also ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "holy",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ": and if the root ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " holy, so ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the branches.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And if some of the branches be broken off, and thou, being a wild olive tree, wert graffed in among them, and with them partakest of the root and fatness of the olive tree;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Boast not against the branches. But if thou boast, thou bearest not the root, but the root thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou wilt say then, The branches were broken off, that I might be graffed in.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Well; because of unbelief they were broken off, and thou standest by faith. Be not highminded, but fear:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For if God spared not the natural branches, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "take heed",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " lest he also spare not thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold therefore the goodness and severity of God: on them which fell, severity; but toward thee, goodness, if thou continue in ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " goodness: otherwise thou also shalt be cut off.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they also, if they abide not still in unbelief, shall be graffed in: for God is able to graff them in again.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For if thou wert cut out of the olive tree which is wild by nature, and wert graffed contrary to nature into a good olive tree: how much more shall these, which be the natural ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "branches",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", be graffed into their own olive tree?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I would not, brethren, that ye should be ignorant of this mystery, lest ye should be wise in your own conceits; that blindness in part is happened to Israel, until the fulness of the Gentiles be come in.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And so all Israel shall be saved: as it is written, There shall come out of Sion the Deliverer, and shall turn away ungodliness from Jacob:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For this ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my covenant unto them, when I shall take away their sins.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As concerning the gospel, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "they are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " enemies for your sakes: but as touching the election, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "they are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " beloved for the fathers’ sakes.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the gifts and calling of God ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " without repentance.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For as ye in times past have not believed God, yet have now obtained mercy through their unbelief:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Even so have these also now not believed, that through your mercy they also may obtain mercy.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For God hath concluded them all in unbelief, that he might have mercy upon all.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O the depth of the riches both of the wisdom and knowledge of God! how unsearchable ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " his judgments, and his ways past finding out!",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For who hath known the mind of the Lord? or who hath been his counsellor?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.35",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.35",
      "verse": 35,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Or who hath first given to him, and it shall be recompensed unto him again?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.11.36",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.11.36",
      "verse": 36,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For of him, and through him, and to him, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " all things: to whom ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " glory for ever. Amen.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
